{"strongs": "H3468", "word": "יֵ֫שַׁע", "translit": "ye.sah", "root": "ישח", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "deliverance, rescue, salvation", "definition": "יֵ֫שַׁע noun masculine Isa 51:5 deliverance, rescue, salvation , also safety, welfare ; — יֵ֫שַׁע Ps 20:7 + 4 t.; יֶ֫שַׁע Job 5:11 + 4 t.; suffix יִשְׁעִי 2Sam 22:3 + 11 t., + 14 t. suffixes; — 1. safety, welfare, prosperity 2Sam 23:5 ; Ps 12:6 ; Job 5:4 ; Job 5:11 . 2. salvation , i.e. primarily physical rescue, by God, often with added spiritual idea: Isa 62:11 ; Ps 69:14 ; Ps 85:8 ; Ps 85:10 יֵשַׁע אֱלֹהִים salvation from God Ps 50:23 used as infin. with accusative לְיֵשַׁע Hab 3:13 (twice in verse) (see Ew § 239 a ); accordingly Yahweh is אוֺרִי וְיִשְׁעִי my light and my salvation Ps 27:1 צוּר ישׁע Ps 95:1 קֶרֶן ישׁע Ps 18:3 = 2Sam 22:3 אֱלֹהֵי ישׁע Isa 17:10 ; Mic 7:7 ; Hab 3:18 ; Ps 18:47 = אֱלֹהֵי צוּר ישׁע 2Sam 22:47 ; Ps 24:5 ; Ps 25:5 ; Ps 27:9 ; Ps 65:6 ; Ps 79:9 ; Ps 85:5 ; 1Chr 16:35 ׳ מָגֵן ישׁ Ps 18:36 = 2Sam 22:36 על אלהים ישׁעי Ps 62:8 || צְדָקָה Isa 45:8 ; Isa 51:5 ; Isa 61:10 שְׂשׂוֺן יִשְׁעֶ֑ךָ Ps 51:14 joy of thy salvation ׳ כֹּהֲנֶיהָ אַלְבִּישׁ ישׁ Ps 132:16 her priests will clothe with salvation. 3. victory: גְּבוּרוֺת יֵשַׁע יְמִינוֺ Ps 20:7 the mighty deeds of the victory of his right hand.", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3805')\">BDB3805</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H3468')\">H3468</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3804')\">BDB3804</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3806')\">BDB3806</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>יֵ֫שַׁע</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Isa 51:5\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(23,51,5)\">Isa 51:5</ref></sup> <highlightword>deliverance, rescue, salvation</highlightword>, also <highlightword>safety, welfare</highlightword>; — <bdbheb>יֵ֫שַׁע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 20:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"7\